# held/props/rod: the fishing rod for the Fish posture (PROPS, P2b): a long, thin pole of dark wood held out over the water,
# its line (linen) hanging from the tip to the water (hold: tilted up, reach: held out). Format: rpg/art/doll/doll.h. Around
# the pose arms' grips, anchored on the right shoulder; under the fists.
